WEBVTT

00:11:29.893 --> 00:11:33.360
What do these two have in common?

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.284
Maybe it's not just the sparkly dress.

00:11:35.284 --> 00:11:38.911
I think these people are experts.

00:11:38.911 --> 00:11:40.437
I think these are the two people in the movie

00:11:40.437 --> 00:11:42.005
who know more than anybody else,

00:11:42.005 --> 00:11:45.332
and they love sharing their knowledge with other people

00:11:45.332 --> 00:11:48.436
to help them reach their potential.

00:11:48.436 --> 00:11:50.444
Now, they are leaders.

00:11:50.444 --> 00:11:52.662
I like that kind of quest for my daughter,

00:11:52.662 --> 00:11:54.849
and I like that kind of quest for my son.

00:11:54.849 --> 00:11:56.760
I want more quests like that.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:59.360
I want fewer quests where my son is told,

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.571
"Go out and fight it alone,"